<title>UK: Johnson Matthey down on Hoare downgrade.</title>
<headline>Johnson Matthey down on Hoare downgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Johnson Matthey Plc fell on Wednesday as analysts at ABN AMRO Hoare Govett downgraded their recommendation on the precious metals and speciality chemicals stock, traders said.</p>
<p>The stock was down 13-1/2p at 597-1/2 by 0941 GMT in moderate volume of 708,396 shares.</p>
